<title>USA: BEC Group to buy assets of Technica unit.</title>
<headline>BEC Group to buy assets of Technica unit.</headline>
<dateline>RYE, N.Y. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BEC Group Inc said on Thursday it signed a letter of intent to buy the operating assets of Technica USA's Byers Equipment Division for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>BEC makes Bolle sunglasses and goggles and other optical technology products. Byers makes ultraviolet exposure systems for printed circuit board fabrication.</p>
<p>BEC said it expects the purchase to be accretive to its earnings in the first year.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
